# v8.1 boots into its default application program, whose motion service
# rewrites WCS bytes every ~3,000 CPU cycles (LFO). Feed left, then right,
# 2 ms input pulses while that runs, so live WCS writes act on real signal.
17200000 audio 512 0 0 0
17204096 audio 0 0 0 0
17600000 audio 0 0 3712 0
17604096 audio 0 0 0 0
18000000 audio 1024 1 0 0
18012288 audio 0 0 0 0
